#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/frame.rst:4
msgid "Frame methods"
msgstr "Frame 方法"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/frame.rst:7
msgid ""
"LiteFrame is a performance-dedicated tabular data object with no index "
"semantics. Column names are flat strings, single-column selection returns"
" a LiteFrame (not a Series), and all operations are column-based with no "
"implicit label alignment. Arrow dtypes are used throughout so that "
"nullable integer columns are preserved rather than promoted to float. "
"Results are lazy — call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame 是一个专为性能设计的表格数据对象，没有索引语义。列名是普通"
"字符串，单列选择返回 LiteFrame（而不是 Series），所有操作都是基于列的，"
"没有隐式的标签对齐。全程使用 Arrow 数据类型，以便保留可空整数列而不是提升"
"为浮点数。结果是惰性的——调用 ``.execute()`` 来实例化。"

